    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Baguette® 26424 handbag is a reissue of FENDI's original 1997 Baguette, adorned with 51,400 colorful beads and intricate embroidery that weave together an exotic decorative motif. The precious lizard-skin shoulder strap and clasp underscore the house's artisanal craftsmanship while channeling the maximalist aesthetic of the early 2000s.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
