    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Hand Embroidery ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Crafted from mulberry silk, the bag features a dazzling embroidered motif hand-stitched by artisans—using up to 51,400 beads and intricate threadwork to create a three-dimensional design. Each bag takes over 173 hours to produce.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for a closer look",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for a closer look",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "On closer inspection, the meticulous beadwork is divided into six square panels, with circular and square geometric motifs embroidered in the center, showcasing superb color harmony and visual depth. The designer has framed the design with delicate floral patterns in orange and green thread, adding a touch of pastoral charm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
