    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Another standout feature is the use of lizard skin—a rare and luxurious material with naturally fine scales and a gradient sheen, as intricate and beautiful as a painting.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w2mm6yo/b01847f05960bf95.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w2mm6yo/4ec214ddb850d81e.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag's clasp is lined with lake-blue lizard skin, its mottled tones exuding an artistic flair, while pink lizard skin covers the FF closure, creating a striking color contrast. The shoulder strap and the sides of the interior zipper are also crafted from lake-blue lizard skin, underscoring an opulent finish.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
