    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Two Lizard-Skin Straps ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Baguette comes with two lizard-skin straps—one long, one short—both adjustable and detachable.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w2mm6yo/2b80aec354cfbf2f.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/w2mm6yo/6269483270c510d7.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With the short strap, it can be carried as a petite top-handle bag. You can also tuck it under your arm, which visually elongates the silhouette—a nod to early-2000s aesthetics.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
