      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Baguette is a familiar shape, and this regular size may look small but holds more than you'd expect. We fit a phone, compact mirror, lipstick, cardholder, and even a book—outperforming some larger bags.",
